# The gated apical compartment: a diagnostic arm of the text parrot chamber (cadence#338), not
# a library option. Apply to a copy of src/ for the diagnostic runs:
#   git apply benchmarks/textparrot/apical_gate.patch      (from the repository root)
# Brain.compose(..., apical=f, apical_gate=g[, apical_gate_keep=True]): a neuron of an apical pool
# receives basal * (1 + g * tanh(t)), t its normalized top-down drive over its bound (gain only),
# or that plus the additive drive (keep). apical_gate=0 is the additive compartment to the bit.
